{"seq":2,"slug":"transit-time-calibrate","title":"在途时长模型校准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/delivery-promise-engine/promise-ops/transit-time-calibrate","wordCount":2934,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"在途时长模型校准\">在途时长模型校准</h1><p>承诺引擎里最容易被忽略的一个事实是：<strong>在途时长模型会腐烂</strong>。它不是因为有 bug，而是因为世界在变——承运商换了目的国的地面合作方、航线改了经停、某个口岸的查验率上升、旺季的舱位紧张把平均时效推后。一套在 1 月校准良好的模型，到 9 月可能已经系统性乐观了 1.5 天，而这个偏差不会自己暴露。</p>\n<p>这一篇讲怎么用真实签收数据反向修正模型，以及校准过程中三个必须处理的统计陷阱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-校准是一个带偏差检测的闭环\">核心概念：校准是一个带偏差检测的闭环</h2><p>校准不是「定期重算分位数」那么简单。重算只是流程的最后一步，前面的偏差检测与归因才是关键——如果模型没有偏，重算只会引入噪声。</p>\n<p>一个完整的校准闭环有四步：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>偏差检测</strong>：对比模型预测与实际签收，判断模型是否偏了，偏在哪个方向、哪个线路。</li>\n<li><strong>归因</strong>：偏差来自真实世界变化（需要更新参数）还是来自数据问题（需要修数据）？</li>\n<li><strong>重算</strong>：在正确的样本上重算分位数，生成新版本。</li>\n<li><strong>灰度与回滚</strong>：新版本先在部分线路上生效，观察违约率变化后再全量。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>跳过第 2 步直接重算是常见的错误：如果偏差来自数据问题（例如某承运商开始回传重复的签收事件，导致时长被低估），重算只会把错误固化进模型。跳过第 4 步则会把一次有问题的重算变成全站事故。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    D[&quot;签收数据&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;偏差检测&lt;br/&gt;预测 vs 实际&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|无显著偏差| SKIP[&quot;跳过,保留当前版本&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|有偏差| A{&quot;归因&quot;}&#10;    A --&gt;|真实世界变化| R[&quot;重算分位数&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt;|数据问题| FIX[&quot;修数据管道&lt;br/&gt;丢弃脏样本&quot;]&#10;    FIX --&gt; B&#10;    R --&gt; G[&quot;灰度:10% 线路&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; M{&quot;违约率改善?&quot;}&#10;    M --&gt;|是| FULL[&quot;全量切换&lt;br/&gt;transit-v62&quot;]&#10;    M --&gt;|否| RB[&quot;回滚到 v61&quot;]\">graph TD\n    D[\"签收数据\"] --&gt; B[\"偏差检测&lt;br/&gt;预测 vs 实际\"]\n    B --&gt;|无显著偏差| SKIP[\"跳过,保留当前版本\"]\n    B --&gt;|有偏差| A{\"归因\"}\n    A --&gt;|真实世界变化| R[\"重算分位数\"]\n    A --&gt;|数据问题| FIX[\"修数据管道&lt;br/&gt;丢弃脏样本\"]\n    FIX --&gt; B\n    R --&gt; G[\"灰度:10% 线路\"]\n    G --&gt; M{\"违约率改善?\"}\n    M --&gt;|是| FULL[\"全量切换&lt;br/&gt;transit-v62\"]\n    M --&gt;|否| RB[\"回滚到 v61\"]</pre><h3 id=\"偏差的度量\">偏差的度量</h3><p>偏差的度量必须是<strong>分位数差异</strong>而不是均值差异。均值差异会被长尾稀释：如果 P50 偏了 2 天而均值只偏了 0.3 天，说明偏差集中在分布主体而不是尾部，这对承诺的影响完全不同（前者影响所有订单，后者只影响部分）。</p>\n<p>推荐的度量是对每个 <code>lane_key</code> 计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>F</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mtext>model</mtext><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>q</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.75</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.9</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_q = \\hat{F}^{-1}(q) - F_{\\text{model}}^{-1}(q), \\qquad q \\in \\{0.5, 0.75, 0.9\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1555em;vertical-align:-0.2914em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4086em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">model</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2914em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.75</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的<strong>模式</strong>比它们的绝对值更有信息量：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>三个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 同向且相近</td>\n<td>整体平移</td>\n<td>直接重算分位数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mn>0.9</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{0.9}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.9</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 显著大于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mn>0.5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{0.5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>分布变胖，尾部恶化了</td>\n<td>检查异常件、查验率、口岸变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mn>0.5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{0.5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 显著大于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mn>0.9</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{0.9}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.9</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>主体变慢但尾部没变</td>\n<td>检查常规路径的变更（航班、转运）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三者为负</td>\n<td>模型偏保守</td>\n<td>可以收紧，但要先确认样本无删失偏差</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"显著性判定\">显著性判定</h3><p>偏差必须显著才值得重算，否则每次波动都会触发无意义的重算，模型会变得对噪声敏感。判定用简单的统计检验：对 <code>lane_key</code> 的签收样本计算分位数的置信区间（bootstrap 是实践中最简单可靠的方法），若模型值落在区间外则判定显著。</p>\n<p>样本量的门槛要按分位数的高低区分：估计 P50 需要几十个样本就够，估计 P90 或 P95 需要数百个样本。一个常见的错误是用「样本数 ≥ 30」这个统一门槛，导致高分位数的估计在样本不足时被反复更新，产生剧烈震荡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三个统计陷阱\">三个统计陷阱</h2><h3 id=\"陷阱一-右删失偏差\">陷阱一：右删失偏差</h3><p>在拉取数据校准的那一刻，一部分订单还在路上。简单地排除「未签收」的订单<strong>恰好排除了最慢的那批</strong>，因此统计出的时长会系统性偏快，模型会越来越乐观。</p>\n<p>三种处理方式按准确度排序：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>准确度</th>\n<th>实现成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>生存分析</td>\n<td>Kaplan-Meier 估计生存函数后求分位数</td>\n<td>最优</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定观察窗口</td>\n<td>只取下单日早于「当前 − N 天」的订单</td>\n<td>中（N 足够大时偏差可忽略）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逆概率加权</td>\n<td>按「仍未签收」概率倒数加权</td>\n<td>理论最优</td>\n<td>最高，易错</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>固定观察窗口（推荐首版）。</strong> 只统计<strong>下单日早于「当前 - N 天」<strong>的订单，N 应大于该线路 P95 在途时长（例如 P95 是 10 个工作日则取 N = 20 个自然日）。这个做法保证所有进入统计的订单都有完整的 N 天观察期，且</strong>排除规则只依赖下单时间、不依赖是否签收</strong>，因此被排除的样本集合与结果无关，偏差被消除。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const MIN_OBSERVE_DAYS = 20;&#10;&#10;function selectCalibrationSamples(asOfDate: string, observations: Observation[]): Observation[] {&#10;  const cutoff = addDays(asOfDate, -MIN_OBSERVE_DAYS);&#10;  return observations.filter((o) =&gt; o.pickedUpAt &lt;= cutoff &amp;&amp; !o.anomalyFlag &amp;&amp; o.deliveredAt !== null);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MIN_OBSERVE_DAYS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> selectCalibrationSamples</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">asOfDate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">observations</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Observation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Observation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cutoff</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> addDays</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(asOfDate, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">MIN_OBSERVE_DAYS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> observations.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> o.pickedUpAt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cutoff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">o.anomalyFlag </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> o.deliveredAt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个筛选的关键在于：排除规则<strong>只依赖下单时间，不依赖是否签收</strong>。这样被排除的样本集合与结果无关，偏差被消除。而如果筛选条件是「取最近 30 天签收的订单」，排除规则就依赖结果了，偏差随之产生。</p>\n<h3 id=\"陷阱二-幸存者偏差\">陷阱二：幸存者偏差</h3><p>已经签收的订单不随机地代表所有订单。典型的偏斜包括：用户地址质量差的订单更容易延误也更容易丢失（永远不签收）、偏远地区的订单延误更多、大促期间的订单整体更慢。</p>\n<p>缓解方式是<strong>按维度分层校准</strong>而不是全局校准，让每个 <code>lane_key</code> 尽量同质：同一个仓、同一个目的国区域、同一个承运商、同一个服务等级。分层越细，每个层的样本越少，因此需要在「同质性」与「样本量」之间权衡。实用的策略是<strong>主键分层 + 回退合并</strong>：优先用最细的分层，样本不足时合并到上一层（例如从「邮编前缀」合并到「州」），并在模型里记录实际使用的层级。</p>\n<h3 id=\"陷阱三-季节性漂移与结构性变化\">陷阱三：季节性漂移与结构性变化</h3><p>在途时长有明显的季节性：跨境旺季（感恩节到圣诞、农历新年前）干线舱位紧张，时效普遍变慢，节后恢复。如果用一个固定的 90 天窗口，那么在旺季末尾校准的模型会包含大量旺季样本，用于淡季就会偏保守；反之则偏乐观。</p>\n<p>处理方式有两种：<strong>滑动窗口 + 季节性调整</strong>（用 90 天窗口，但按当前所处季节做偏移修正），或<strong>同季节窗口</strong>（用去年同期的数据，样本量小但季节匹配）。前者响应快、样本足；后者准确但滞后一年、新线路无法使用。实践推荐前者，并把季节偏移量作为显式参数而非隐含在窗口里。</p>\n<p><strong>结构性变化</strong>是比季节性更麻烦的情况：承运商换了合作方、航线永久改道、某国海关规则变更。这类变化的特征是<strong>阶跃</strong>而非渐变。检测方法是按周聚合 P90 并画时序图——阶跃会非常明显。处理方式是<strong>截断历史</strong>：只使用阶跃点之后的数据，因为之前的数据来自一个已经不存在的过程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"校准的实现\">校准的实现</h2><h3 id=\"重算与版本发布\">重算与版本发布</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE transit_model_version (&#10;  lane_key        VARCHAR(64)  NOT NULL,&#10;  model_version   VARCHAR(24)  NOT NULL,&#10;  transit_p50     DECIMAL(5,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  transit_p75     DECIMAL(5,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  transit_p90     DECIMAL(5,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  transit_p95     DECIMAL(5,2) NULL,&#10;  unit            VARCHAR(32)  NOT NULL,&#10;  sample_window   VARCHAR(24)  NOT NULL,&#10;  sample_size     INT          NOT NULL,&#10;  excluded_ratio  DECIMAL(5,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  state           ENUM(&#39;candidate&#39;,&#39;canary&#39;,&#39;active&#39;,&#39;retired&#39;,&#39;rolled_back&#39;) NOT NULL,&#10;  canary_scope    JSON         NULL,&#10;  published_at    DATETIME     NOT NULL,&#10;  activated_at    DATETIME     NULL,&#10;  retired_at      DATETIME     NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (lane_key, model_version),&#10;  KEY idx_active (lane_key, state)&#10;) ENGINE=InnoDB;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> transit_model_version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lane_key        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  model_version   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  transit_p50     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  transit_p75     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  transit_p90     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  transit_p95     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  unit            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sample_window   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sample_size     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  excluded_ratio  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">           ENUM(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'candidate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'canary'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'active'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'retired'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rolled_back'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  canary_scope    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  published_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  activated_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  retired_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (lane_key, model_version),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_active (lane_key, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) ENGINE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">InnoDB;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>state</code> 的五个取值构成生命周期：<code>candidate</code>（重算产出，未生效）→ <code>canary</code>（灰度中，<code>canary_scope</code> 描述生效范围）→ <code>active</code>（全量生效）→ <code>retired</code>（被新版本取代）或 <code>rolled_back</code>（回滚）。<strong>旧版本必须保留</strong>（<code>retired</code> 而非删除），因为承诺快照里记录了模型版本（见 <a href=\"../promise-presentation/promise-to-fulfillment-handoff\">承诺到履约的传递与锁定</a>），没有旧版本数据就无法复现历史承诺。</p>\n<p><code>excluded_ratio</code> 记录被排除的样本比例。这个值本身是一个质量信号：如果它突然从 3% 跳到 40%，说明数据管道出了问题（例如签收事件大面积缺失），此时不应信任这次重算结果。</p>\n<h3 id=\"灰度与回滚\">灰度与回滚</h3><p>灰度必须<strong>按线路</strong>而不是按流量比例。原因是校准是线路级的：一条线路的模型坏了，按流量灰度的做法会让同一线路的用户随机地看到两种承诺日，这本身就是不一致。按线路灰度则保证同一条线路上所有用户看到同一个版本，且影响范围可精确控制。</p>\n<p>灰度的判据是<strong>违约率变化</strong>而不是「模型看起来更准」。具体流程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>选 10% 的线路（优先选择流量适中、业务重要性中等的线路）切换到 <code>canary</code>。</li>\n<li>观察 7-14 天，比较灰度线路与对照线路的违约率变化。</li>\n<li>若违约率显著改善（或至少不恶化），切换为 <code>active</code>；否则 <code>rolled_back</code>。</li>\n<li>全量切换后继续观察 30 天，作为最终确认。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>第 2 步的比较必须用<strong>同期对照</strong>（灰度线路 vs 未灰度的相似线路），而不是与灰度前的历史比较——因为期间可能有季节性或外部变化影响所有线路。</p>\n<h3 id=\"回滚的触发条件\">回滚的触发条件</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>判定</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>灰度期违约率恶化的 1.5 倍以上</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n<td>立即回滚到上一 <code>active</code> 版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承诺日分布突变（中位数位移 &gt; 2 天）</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n<td>回滚并告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>excluded_ratio</code> &gt; 30%</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n<td>回滚（数据质量不可信）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样本量 &lt; 门槛</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n<td>跳过该线路，保留旧版本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>全部四个条件都应当是<strong>自动</strong>的，不需要人工确认。理由很实际：校准通常在夜间批处理中运行，人工确认意味着一个夜晚的窗口被浪费；而回滚的代价（回到一个已知可用的旧模型）远小于继续使用一个可疑的新模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与上下游的接口\">与上下游的接口</h2><p><strong>上游</strong>：签收数据来自承运商回传与履约反馈，其清洗规则见 <a href=\"../promise-data-calendar/transit-time-sla-data\">在途时长与承运 SLA 数据</a>。校准<strong>不修改</strong>原始观测表，只读取并产出模型版本——这条边界保证原始数据始终可作为审计依据。</p>\n<p><strong>下游</strong>：新版本被 <a href=\"../atp-ctp-compute/capable-to-promise-date\">可承诺交货期（CTP）推算</a> 消费。发布方式应是<strong>进程内模型数据的整块热替换</strong>（见 <a href=\"../atp-ctp-compute/capable-to-promise-date\">可承诺交货期（CTP）推算</a> 中的性能设计），而不是让承诺服务每次请求去查模型表。</p>\n<p><strong>反馈</strong>：校准的效果最终由 <a href=\"promise-accuracy-violation\">承诺准确率与违约监控</a> 衡量。两者的关系是「理论违约率 vs 实测违约率」这一对照——模型校准的目标就是让这两条曲线贴合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>在途时长模型会因真实世界变化而腐烂；校准是一个闭环：偏差检测 → 归因 → 重算 → 灰度回滚。跳过归因会把数据问题固化进模型，跳过灰度会把重算变成事故。</li>\n<li>偏差用三个分位数差异 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mn>0.5</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mn>0.75</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mn>0.9</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{0.5}, \\Delta_{0.75}, \\Delta_{0.9}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.75</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.9</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的<strong>模式</strong>来解读：整体平移、尾部变胖、主体变慢、模型偏保守，各自对应不同的动作。</li>\n<li>显著性判定要按分位数区分样本门槛（P50 几十个样本、P90/P95 数百个），用 bootstrap 置信区间，避免高频无意义重算。</li>\n<li>三个统计陷阱：右删失偏差（筛选条件必须只依赖下单时间，不依赖是否签收）、幸存者偏差（按 <code>lane_key</code> 分层 + 回退合并）、季节性与结构性变化（滑动窗口 + 显式季节偏移；阶跃变化要截断历史）。</li>\n<li>模型版本表必须保留 <code>retired</code> 版本，因为承诺快照记录了模型版本，删除会导致历史承诺不可复现；<code>excluded_ratio</code> 是数据管道健康度的一级信号。</li>\n<li>灰度按<strong>线路</strong>而非流量比例；判据是同期对照的违约率变化；四个回滚条件全部自动触发，不等人工确认。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>模型调准之后还剩最后一个问题：承诺得快多少，值多少钱。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"在途时长模型校准","id":"在途时长模型校准"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：校准是一个带偏差检测的闭环","id":"核心概念-校准是一个带偏差检测的闭环"},{"level":3,"text":"偏差的度量","id":"偏差的度量"},{"level":3,"text":"显著性判定","id":"显著性判定"},{"level":2,"text":"三个统计陷阱","id":"三个统计陷阱"},{"level":3,"text":"陷阱一：右删失偏差","id":"陷阱一-右删失偏差"},{"level":3,"text":"陷阱二：幸存者偏差","id":"陷阱二-幸存者偏差"},{"level":3,"text":"陷阱三：季节性漂移与结构性变化","id":"陷阱三-季节性漂移与结构性变化"},{"level":2,"text":"校准的实现","id":"校准的实现"},{"level":3,"text":"重算与版本发布","id":"重算与版本发布"},{"level":3,"text":"灰度与回滚","id":"灰度与回滚"},{"level":3,"text":"回滚的触发条件","id":"回滚的触发条件"},{"level":2,"text":"与上下游的接口","id":"与上下游的接口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"承诺准确率与违约监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/delivery-promise-engine/promise-ops/promise-accuracy-violation"},"next":{"title":"承诺时效与物流成本权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/delivery-promise-engine/promise-ops/promise-cost-tradeoff"}}